  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-07T18:33:43.716Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "After installing the new VR Chat update I can no longer join worlds or change avatars. When I try to join a world I tend to get one of two things. It either refuses to load the world completely and just places me in my home world, or it starts a never ending loading loop that causes my game to crash. There's also an issue when I try to change into avatars. After clicking the change avatar button all I'm greeted with is the error robot. It seems that even previews refuse to load within the avatar menu and show the exact same error robot. This is incredibly frustrating and I know I'm not the only one experiencing these problems. Please have someone test all updates before making them live to avoid issues like this in the future.",
